{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hambagu Shop</strong> is a\u00a0cozy horror narrative simulator where you work in a Japanese Hamburg Steak Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mari, a teenage girl who work in a popular hamburg steak shop branch and was promoted to branch manager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/adec273bd85a915cb389c08a2f274981.poster.avif?t=1768385219\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/adec273bd85a915cb389c08a2f274981.webm?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/adec273bd85a915cb389c08a2f274981.mp4?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook hamburg dishes, serve customers, and upgrade your shop for more menu items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/dc2127d2cbffbaca48705aa6cf902e71.poster.avif?t=1768385219\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/dc2127d2cbffbaca48705aa6cf902e71.webm?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/dc2127d2cbffbaca48705aa6cf902e71.mp4?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack Hamburg on rice and other ingredients to create various different dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/f1bf4de1fe9b12c464eec80cdc1b5880.poster.avif?t=1768385219\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/f1bf4de1fe9b12c464eec80cdc1b5880.webm?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/f1bf4de1fe9b12c464eec80cdc1b5880.mp4?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While serving customers, you may see haunting visions around the shop which led you the believe that the shop is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/8ebbba755cc58db25ddcd36e80504531.poster.avif?t=1768385219\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/8ebbba755cc58db25ddcd36e80504531.webm?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/8ebbba755cc58db25ddcd36e80504531.mp4?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hambagu Shop</strong> builds tension through eerie atmosphere, unsettling events, and sudden intense scare when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/fa9092d1fa1b220b9f7547f2585b19b2.poster.avif?t=1768385219\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/extras/fa9092d1fa1b220b9f7547f2585b19b2.webm?t=1768385219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: a simple yet engaging loop, grill hamburg, prepare side dishes and serve customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Aesthetics: Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story: Uncover Mari's personal story as she works in a Japanese hamburg Steak shop</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Content Creators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991140?t=1768385219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/9773b58bbeaa7f21998bb0a23743e8f60a60c513/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768385219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/9e96963fdaad8783ebdda3fdbbe9d4842c1b130b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768385219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/9e96963fdaad8783ebdda3fdbbe9d4842c1b130b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768385219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hambagu Shop</strong> is a\u00a0cozy horror narrative simulator where you work in a Japanese Hamburg Steak Shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mari, a teenage girl who work in a popular hamburg steak shop branch and was