</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: a simple yet engaging loop, grill hamburg, prepare side dishes and serve customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS Aesthetics: Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story: Uncover Mari's personal story as she works in a Japanese hamburg Steak shop</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Content Creators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p>","developers":["Mike Ten"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991140/1bb2584981aeb975d89d87d1cdbc1895e4eeb7a6/header.jpg?t=1768385219","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991140/1126817962/527b94f12d58ee5b25a9ebef9de9fc8e8c7d1b18/1759219810/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761240567","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991140/1126817962/527b94f12d58ee5b25a9ebef9de9fc8e8c7d1b18/1759219810/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761240567","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991140/1126817962/527b94f12d58ee5b25a9ebef9de9fc8e8c7d1b18/1759219810/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761240567","id":257209123,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209123/7f097a611124e5ca4331de73b94f033ee4443883/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761240567"}],"name":"The Hambagu Shop","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750ti or b